# VocaFlow Frontend Environment Variables Configuration Template

# API Endpoint URL (Express HTTP Rest Server)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Live WebSocket Voice server domain (Must point to your Ngrok/Reverse Proxy HTTPS domain)
VITE_SERVER_URL=https://<your_subdomain>.ngrok-free.dev

# Platform Main twilio dialer outbound phone number
VITE_TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1XXXXXXXXXX
